{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aBook of Fei\u300b is a cute and casual idle RPG played directly on your computer desktop. The game interface appears at the bottom of your system desktop, offering adorable companionship during busy work hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733510/extras/cc7c075ed6e9e0024ba3e7268c950537.poster.avif?t=1771647380\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733510/extras/cc7c075ed6e9e0024ba3e7268c950537.webm?t=1771647380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733510/extras/cc7c075ed6e9e0024ba3e7268c950537.mp4?t=1771647380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Worlds, Battle and Work on Your Desktop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure through different regions in the book world, challenge monsters, defeat the Demon King, and uncover the truth of this realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your heroes battle, level up, and work part-time jobs at the bottom of your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with heroes to deepen bonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733510/extras/edecb1693fc6c368059daff38642b757.poster.avif?t=1771647380\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733510/extras/edecb1693fc6c368059daff38642b757.webm?t=1771647380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733510/extras/edecb1693fc6c368059daff38642b757.mp4?t=1771647380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733510/extras/062f323d1d34866d689d65b28460ee49.poster.avif?t=1771647380\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733510/extras/062f323d1d34866d689d65b28460ee49.webm?t=1771647380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733510/extras/062f323d1d34866d689d65b28460ee49.mp4?t=1771647380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 Characters, 24 Advanced Classes, Hundreds of Equipment &amp; Card Gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command heroes to adventure in various regions for leveling up and unlocking advanced classes to become the ultimate warrior. Collect rare card gear with different effects to modify heroes' abilities and build the strongest party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign heroes to work in different areas to earn gold, then purchase and collect superior equipment, combat mechanisms, and enhancement badges to fully boost your team's power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733510/extras/449970f13ca7ff02253da1454b13a870.poster.avif?t=1771647380\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733510/extras/449970f13ca7ff02253da1454b13a870.webm?t=1771647380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733510/extras/449970f13ca7ff02253da1454b13a870.mp4?t=1771647380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Badges &amp; Props to Perfect Your Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire badges and scene props with various 